{
 "doc": "M4-C10-02 greybox (tools/act1/ch10_greybox.py; do not edit by hand): Ossa Fen at the overcast dusk (colour script ch10). The fen's edge is the dry bank at the west, where the coast road from Corrow ends and Pell stops (act1_ch09.md \u00a710: the first image of Act II); the Kirru's root-walks run east over tannin water between mangrove trunks, a side pocket north, the Drowner's clearing (the boss's arena, DrownerArena) and the way on to Reedhollow (to_reedhollow). The story waits on the beat sheet (M4-C10-01).",
